{"parse": {"title": "TTS-18", "pageid": 141723, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TTS-17\" title=\"TTS-17\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TTS-18</span><a href=\"/wiki/TTS-19\" title=\"TTS-19\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TTS</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">18</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.9C.AA.E6.9D.A5.E4.B8.BB.E4.B9.89.E5.AE.A3.E8.A8.80\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"未来主义宣言\">未来主义宣言</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 未来主义宣言</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">To Claim Tomorrow</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>所<span class=\"color-value\"></span>指<span class=\"color-value\"></span>引<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>道<span class=\"color-value\"></span>路<span class=\"color-value\"></span>从<span class=\"color-value\"></span>来<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>清<span class=\"color-value\"></span>晰<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span>道<span class=\"color-value\"></span>路<span class=\"color-value\"></span>从<span class=\"color-value\"></span>来<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>清<span class=\"color-value\"></span>晰<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3810118</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"gaocengbangongshi\"><img alt=\"gaocengbangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png/600px-Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png/900px-Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>规律的叩门声让副会长从忙碌中抬起了头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>请进……许久不见，肯纳女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>是“新办事处建设”项目的推进事宜吗？我已经通知过，后续工程部直接向伊里内伊委员汇报即可。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>来访者神色凝重。她将一组报告轻轻放在办公桌上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>下午好，康斯坦丁女士。拉普拉斯科算中心刚发来了……关于“时空灾害”原发现场的初步勘测报告。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>尽管现场也受到了“时空灾害”影响，但科算中心仍在伊戈尔将军指认的“原点”，探测到了未知能量的残留。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>他们在全球多个观测点架设了克里安相机，并且拍摄到了一些异常显影的照片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>结合多点分析，科算中心推测，观测点环境中存在某些目前无法确认的物质，或许与“时空灾害”密切相关。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>现在我们无法确认其为“因”还是“果”，但可以给出肯定结论的是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>委员轻轻吸了一口气，随即抛出结论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>“时空灾害”有可能再度降临。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>现有技术还无法估算出具体时间，但科算中心会持续监测，并根据变化更新预警……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-506810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-506810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-506810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>我明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>希曼女士正在对会议文件进行必要的脱敏，以尽快召开内部会议。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>我作为与“时空灾害”防御密切相关的项目负责人之一，被提前告知了这一消息，但我认为您同样需要第一时间获知详情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>康斯坦丁指尖轻敲桌面，平静地消化着这一重磅消息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>感谢你的信息同步，肯纳女士。但你应当知晓，我只会比任何人早一步得知这一消息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>如此突然的来访……我想，你或许有其他要事需要同我汇报？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>我从不敢低估您的洞察力，康斯坦丁女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红发女士神秘地微笑，她打开副会长办公室紧闭的门，向寂静的走廊招了招手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一株摇晃的矢车菊小心翼翼地闯了进来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>请允许我向您介绍，这位是项目派遣至诺瓦米奇的先遣调查员——柏林以东小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>您好，康斯坦丁女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>柏林以东礼貌地微微躬身以作问好，但话语中难掩急切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>距离我将诺瓦米奇穹顶模型送回基金会已经十五小时了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>不知道您是否已经查看过它了？我这里还有一些关于“实验性修复”的补充汇报，想请您一并过目——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>康斯坦丁靠回座椅，双手撑在下巴上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>我看过了。你们让回声石恢复了活性，这是一份有价值的成果。但在现在这个阶段，恐怕不足以改变委员会的判断。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>可是……诺瓦米奇的团队，为了这份模型付出了很多努力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>初次踏足此地的少女显然有些局促。她小心翼翼地表达着自己的观点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>或许您至少可以考虑再召开一次会议……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>很遗憾，孩子。在我看来，这个项目既不安全，也不稳定，在我们随时面临未知威胁的当下，更无必要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>有人从身后拍了拍她的肩膀，取下了压力的担子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>在我看来……正因为“不必要”，或许它才重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>哦？愿闻其详。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>资金、人员、武器装备、科研……眼下，基金会真正必要的资源，已经被我们全部用于“必要”的防守。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她停顿一瞬，缓缓开口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>可在我看来，一个组织从不是靠所谓的“必要”延续的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>你是在指责基金会变得保守。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>不，我只是在描述一个趋势——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>我们正在把生存当作目标，而不是前提。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>肯纳从柏林以东手中取过一盒录像带。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>我无意对委员会的决定提出复议申请。此次拜访，只是为了绕过繁琐的会议约谈手续。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>祝您拥有愉快的一天，康斯坦丁女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她将录像带以及一沓厚厚的文件放在办公桌的一角，带着监听专家走出会议室。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>正因为“不必要”，它才重要……呵呵，很狡猾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沉默片刻后，康斯坦丁站起身，拾起桌上的录像带。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>放映机轻松地吞吐磁带，发出微弱的嗡嗡声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一段模糊的影像自墙面显现。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_at_23.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_at_23\"><img alt=\"3_8_at_23\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-3_8_at_23.png/600px-Cg-3_8_at_23.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-3_8_at_23.png/900px-Cg-3_8_at_23.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-3_8_at_23.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_at_23.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>是奠基石。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她站在风中，面朝镜头的方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>说实话，在按下录像键之前，我已经写了好几版讲稿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>也准备了很多施工过程的文件、照片和草图。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但最后，我决定换一种方式——带你们看一看这里的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师将镜头稍稍拉远，以便露出身后的施工现场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那里，人们各司其职，没人朝镜头看一眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>曾有人说：“没人是自己故土的先知。”时至今日，我才真正理解它的含义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>居民们总是超出我的预期。从施工第一天起，他们就知道这几乎是一个不可能成功的尝试。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对此，他们的反应是简单而直接的：先做，再说——就如同他们现在做的那样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我们一起完善草图、搭建模型、拆除墙壁……我们完成了一个又一个艰难的任务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>现在，我终于有机会站在镜头前，将这一切交由在座诸位审视。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>听听这里的声音吧——铁锤的敲击声、风吹过梁柱裂隙的声响，以及尘埃在光中的呼吸声……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它们并不整齐，却彼此回应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>正是这些被接纳的、不完美的回应，才构成了这里稳固的基础。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她深吸一口气，露出微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在我看来，诺瓦米奇的重建并非勇敢的象征，它只是一个判断——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_at_24.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_at_24\"><img alt=\"3_8_at_24\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Cg-3_8_at_24.png/600px-Cg-3_8_at_24.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Cg-3_8_at_24.png/900px-Cg-3_8_at_24.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Cg-3_8_at_24.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_at_24.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我们是否还愿意在不确定中行动，而不是等世界推着我们做决定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回声石活了，说明这条路并非死路；真正的死路，是我们决定不再继续向前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不重建并不见得更加理性。它只是把风险推给未来，推到我们看不见、也不想负责的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如果基金会只会筑墙，那么迟早有一天，我们会发现墙外的世界并没有消失，它只是换了一种方式闯入。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>因此，这不仅是一次重建，更关乎我们要不要继续成为一个愿意押注未来的组织。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>放映机的转盘仍在缓缓转动，画面偶尔抖动、偏色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可声音却出奇地清晰。它穿过噪点，穿过灰尘与光的缝隙，清清楚楚地回荡在屋内。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"gaocengbangongshi\"><img alt=\"gaocengbangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png/600px-Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png/900px-Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-506810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-506810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-506810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>目光落在桌前厚厚的一沓文件上。计算用的稿纸、照片、杂乱的草图……而最上面，静静地躺着一本陈旧的笔记本。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>纸张一页页翻开，里面详细记录着从项目启动到如今的一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它始于一场微小的抱怨——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-typerbg.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"typerbg\"><img alt=\"typerbg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/600px-Cg-typerbg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/900px-Cg-typerbg.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/1200px-Cg-typerbg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>“抵达诺瓦米奇的第3天。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>“浑浊的河水、公路，徘徊不去的雾气……或许只是因为心情低落，在我看来，这里的一切似乎都是灰色的。”</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuizoulang2\"><img alt=\"jijinhuizoulang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会官员：</div><div>借一步说话，柏林以东小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>当然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她暂别一同走出的肯纳女士，与官员来到一个僻静的角落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会官员：</div><div>听说你刚从诺瓦米奇回来就去了拉普拉斯，然后又再三求见康斯坦丁女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会官员：</div><div>我曾告诫过你——保持中立。这次任务，你本应扮演一个旁观者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>是吗？那么请问，我们保持中立的目的是什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会官员：</div><div>当然是为了不在基金会内部继续制造分裂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会官员：</div><div>我相信你已经察觉到了，最近基金会内部悄然出现了两股不同的势力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会官员：</div><div>眼下正是关键时刻，如果放任这种分化的趋势，很快就会演变成不可忽视的局面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>少女低下头，不再言语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的沉默里带着明显的坚持——至少在这个节骨眼上，她不愿意退让。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>事实上，我现在的游说工作小有成效，虽然目前只有几个新晋的年轻委员同意重建方案……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>因此我认为，这绝非制造分裂，而是在达成共识。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会官员：</div><div>暂时。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会官员：</div><div>你所说的共识……柏林以东，是短暂而脆弱的、基于现实的妥协。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-654403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会官员：</div><div>我们不应该天真地期待它能持久。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>柏林以东收起笑，表情专注而认真。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>但我认为……即使是暂时的，也值得为之努力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>这样，即使未来分裂出现，大家偶尔也能回想起……曾经达成共识的瞬间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>对我来说，这就足够了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员：</div><div>打扰一下，柏林以东小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>骤然响起的声音打断了二人的对谈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员：</div><div>幸好您还没有离开太远。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员：</div><div>康斯坦丁女士请您回办公室一趟，有关诺瓦米奇的重建项目……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>柏林以东慢慢睁大了眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她忽然有了一种良好的预感。天高路远，一切都将变得不同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>好的，我马上就到。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TTS-18"}}